    <div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>交易池</th><th>區間狀態</th><th>目前 Tick／部位區間</th><th>超出幅度</th><th>區間外時間</th><th>距複查</th><th>再平衡資格</th><th>目標區間</th><th>價值／未領手續費</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="positions"></tbody></table></div>
